  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41159668",
      "title": "Adding a Custom Component To A Layout",
      "lectureOrder": 98,
      "videoOrder": 91,
      "sourceHash": "1d8524b6da019c1fc12d60c4b1667a4d1b1af9e5d631c8346f29fe0a474ad4a7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 1.02,
          "end": 2.88,
          "en": "Now to add that header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.88,
          "end": 5.79,
          "en": "I'll add a brand new component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.79,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "We could of course also just add it in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 9.36,
          "en": "here in this layout file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.36,
          "end": 11.61,
          "en": "But in order to keep this a bit leaner,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.61,
          "end": 13.77,
          "en": "I'll add a separate component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.77,
          "end": 16.8,
          "en": "and I'll actually also outsource this div here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.8,
          "end": 19.41,
          "en": "into a separate component thereafter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 21.39,
          "en": "And therefore I'll add a new file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 21.39,
          "end": 24.36,
          "en": "which should store that component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 24.36,
          "end": 27.273,
          "en": "And we could name it main-header.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.17,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "Now, as I also mentioned before, it is up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 34.38,
          "en": "where you store those component files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.38,
          "end": 37.68,
          "en": "If they don't have any reserved name like page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.68,
          "end": 40.56,
          "en": "or a layout, NextJS doesn't care.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.56,
          "end": 42.03,
          "en": "You can add them like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 42.03,
          "end": 45.3,
          "en": "or inside of a components folder, in the app folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.3,
          "end": 47.01,
          "en": "wherever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.01,
          "end": 50.58,
          "en": "But I personally prefer to keep them out of the app folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 50.58,
          "end": 55.08,
          "en": "so that the app folder is really only dealing with routing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 55.08,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "and not with those other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 60.6,
          "en": "But that's just a personal preference.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 64.14,
          "en": "There is this entire article in the NextJS documentation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.14,
          "end": 68.343,
          "en": "that discusses different ways of structuring Next projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.63,
          "end": 72.75,
          "en": "Now here, I'll keep it out of the app folder though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.75,
          "end": 75.78,
          "en": "and therefore it's now in this main-header.js file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.78,
          "end": 77.67,
          "en": "where I wanna set up this header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.67,
          "end": 79.833,
          "en": "that should be shared across all pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 80.88,
          "end": 84.66,
          "en": "And for that in here, I'll export another React component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 84.66,
          "end": 89.03999999999999,
          "en": "which I'll name MainHeader, a regular React component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.03999999999999,
          "end": 91.11,
          "en": "as you know and love it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.11,
          "end": 96.003,
          "en": "And then there I'll return a header element like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 97.77000000000001,
          "end": 100.28999999999999,
          "en": "And in that header, I then wanna have a logo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.28999999999999,
          "end": 103.44,
          "en": "and the main navigation of this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 103.44,
          "end": 106.47,
          "en": "Now that logo should be clickable and",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 106.47,
          "end": 109.28999999999999,
          "en": "therefore I'll start by adding a link here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 109.28999999999999,
          "end": 112.86,
          "en": "using the link component provided by NextJS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 112.86,
          "end": 115.02000000000001,
          "en": "so that we can wrap that around the logo",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.02000000000001,
          "end": 117,
          "en": "to make it clickable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 117,
          "end": 120.12,
          "en": "And the idea is that clicking the logo simply takes us back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120.12,
          "end": 123.363,
          "en": "to the starting page, so to this path here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 126.45,
          "end": 130.17,
          "en": "but then the logo should actually be the combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.17,
          "end": 133.32,
          "en": "of an image and some text.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 133.32,
          "end": 136.35,
          "en": "And therefore we can use that image element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.35,
          "end": 138.54,
          "en": "that default image element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 138.54,
          "end": 142.29,
          "en": "and then set the source to a certain image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 142.29,
          "end": 144.15,
          "en": "And I wanna set it to an image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.15,
          "end": 147.81,
          "en": "which I provided as part of the starting project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 147.81,
          "end": 150.87,
          "en": "There, I provided this assets folder to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 150.87,
          "end": 155.87,
          "en": "And that assets folder then has a logo PNG file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.94,
          "end": 158.073,
          "en": "which is that logo I want to use.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 159.69,
          "end": 162.93,
          "en": "Now the great thing in NextJS projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.93,
          "end": 165.18,
          "en": "like in most React projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.18,
          "end": 168.03,
          "en": "is that you can simply import such an image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.03,
          "end": 169.98,
          "en": "into your JavaScript files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.98,
          "end": 174.42000000000002,
          "en": "and you'll then automatically get a path to those images.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 177.57,
          "en": "So here I'll import my logo image from,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.57,
          "end": 180.78,
          "en": "and then I'll use this alias here to refer",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 180.78,
          "end": 182.97,
          "en": "to the root directory of my project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.97,
          "end": 186.21,
          "en": "this at symbol, and I'll therefore import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.21,
          "end": 189.18,
          "en": "that logo from at assets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.18,
          "end": 193.083,
          "en": "And then there the logo.png file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 198.27,
          "en": "And that's then the source of this image, though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 198.27,
          "end": 200.57999999999998,
          "en": "What's important in Next projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 200.57999999999998,
          "end": 203.07,
          "en": "unlike in many other React projects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 203.07,
          "end": 205.641,
          "en": "is that you can't just assign it like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.641,
          "end": 210.21,
          "en": "It's that you have to access the SRC property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 210.21,
          "end": 213.69,
          "en": "because this imported logo in Next projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.69,
          "end": 218.01,
          "en": "will be an object where the path to the image is then stored",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.01,
          "end": 220.173,
          "en": "under that SRC property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.3,
          "end": 225.84,
          "en": "With that, I'll also assign an alt text, a plate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 225.84,
          "end": 228.993,
          "en": "with food on it, sounds fitting for this logo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 230.34,
          "end": 232.023,
          "en": "And that's my image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 234.42000000000002,
          "end": 237.72,
          "en": "Now, I also wanna have some text next to that image.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.72,
          "end": 238.71,
          "en": "And here the name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 238.71,
          "end": 241.683,
          "en": "of this demo app is simply next level food.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 243.78,
          "end": 246.27,
          "en": "So that's now my logo.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 246.27,
          "end": 249.69,
          "en": "And we could outsource this into a separate component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 249.69,
          "end": 251.52,
          "en": "as well if we wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 251.52,
          "end": 254.12,
          "en": "But here I'll keep it in this main header component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.84,
          "end": 257.97,
          "en": "Now, that's not everything though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 257.97,
          "end": 262.02,
          "en": "Instead I also want to have my navigation here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 262.02,
          "end": 265.65,
          "en": "hence I'll add a nav element and in there an unordered list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 265.65,
          "end": 267.423,
          "en": "and in there a list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 269.43,
          "end": 273.21,
          "en": "And that list item should then contain another link leading",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 273.21,
          "end": 275.34000000000003,
          "en": "to a certain page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 275.34000000000003,
          "end": 279.36,
          "en": "To be precise, a link that allows us to browse the meals",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.36,
          "end": 281.763,
          "en": "that have been shared by community members.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.93,
          "end": 285.213,
          "en": "So here, it should lead to slash meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 286.74,
          "end": 288.99,
          "en": "Now, that's not the only link though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 288.99,
          "end": 292.35,
          "en": "Instead I'll also add another link, which should allow us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.35,
          "end": 295.74,
          "en": "to go to the community, to the Foodies Community.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 295.74,
          "end": 300.74,
          "en": "And hence here, it should lead to slash community like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 300.87,
          "end": 303,
          "en": "That's my navigation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 303,
          "end": 304.29,
          "en": "With that all added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 304.29,
          "end": 307.5,
          "en": "and with this main header component finished, we can go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 307.5,
          "end": 309.51,
          "en": "to that root layout",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.51,
          "end": 312.3,
          "en": "and then there output this main header",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 312.3,
          "end": 317.193,
          "en": "above that children slot here, so above the page content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 318.3,
          "end": 321.12,
          "en": "Simply like this though, very important,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 321.12,
          "end": 323.52,
          "en": "you of course must import it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 323.52,
          "end": 325.68,
          "en": "So here I added this import from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 325.68,
          "end": 328.773,
          "en": "that components folder in the root project directory.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 331.11,
          "end": 332.34000000000003,
          "en": "If you do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 332.34000000000003,
          "end": 335.90999999999997,
          "en": "and you save everything, you should see something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 335.90999999999997,
          "end": 339.24,
          "en": "if you revisit the page, a total mess,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 339.24,
          "end": 343.65,
          "en": "but at least the header is there, it's there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 343.65,
          "end": 346.71,
          "en": "and it's working, and it's there on every page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 346.71,
          "end": 347.90999999999997,
          "en": "which is amazing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 347.90999999999997,
          "end": 350.1,
          "en": "And we can also go back to the starting page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 350.1,
          "end": 353.97,
          "en": "but of course it's totally unstyled and doesn't look good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 353.97,
          "end": 356.433,
          "en": "And that's therefore what we'll change next.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
